prop mapscreen else.use=message||A map screen of the delta, dark. Three relay dots, unlit. The fork sign by the river cross names them.
prop cranepad obj.name=cranepad
prop cranepad beh.use=Type the route code
prop cranepad lock.code=4172
prop cranepad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\ngive||story:route*1\nmessage||The strongbox opens: the river people's route, drawn on oilcloth, every channel up to the rise.
prop cranepad else.use=message||A strongbox with a keypad, out on the end of the jib. The outpost's map screen knows the code.
quest title=The Rivers
quest intro=Three river arms into the jungle. Make for the tall timber-port crane, then go to the river mouth and its chart post.
step reach|mouth|1|Go to the river mouth and its chart post
step read|River chart|1|Read the river people's chart
step blueprint|Blueprint_Machete|1|Take the machete plans from the outpost's tool rack
step reach|west_arm|1|Cut through the vines to the rope ferry
step collect|story:ferry|1|Wind the rope ferry across
step reach|upriver|1|Go upriver
step kill|Warthog|3|Drive off the three boars
step blueprint|Blueprint_Fueltank|1|Take the fuel tank plans from the fuel cache
step blueprint|Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel|1|Take the fuel pipe plans from the fuel cache
step collect|story:fuelcan|3|Find three fuel cans: by the ferry landing, in the drawbridge camp and in the fuel cache crate
step collect|story:pressed|1|Cut the vines by the pressing shed and fill the press
step blueprint|Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor|1|Take the biofuel extractor plans from the pressing shed
step collect|story:fuse|1|Dive to the sunk barge off the mouth for the relay fuse
step collect|story:relay|3|Switch on three relays: by the landing, over the drawbridge, behind the vines
step collect|story:rivercode|1|Read the route code on the outpost's map screen
step reach|dl_top|1|Climb the timber port's crane on the bluff
